gojja2 is an independent, clean-room-style reimplementation of the Jinja2
template language in Go. No source code from the projects below is copied into
this repository; they are consulted as behavioural references and used as test
oracles/fixtures at development time only.

  * Jinja (https://github.com/pallets/jinja) - BSD-3-Clause.
    The CPython implementation is used as the ground-truth oracle: expected
    output for the conformance corpus is produced by rendering templates with
    the real `jinja2` package. Jinja's own pytest suite is consulted as a
    source of behavioural cases.

  * MiniJinja (https://github.com/mitsuhiko/minijinja) - Apache-2.0.
    Its template fixture corpus is consulted as a source of behavioural cases.

Neither project's sources are redistributed here. `make suites` downloads them
into ./third_party/, which is excluded from version control.
